{
  "name": "Localnord · Publish a weekly Google post",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Publish a weekly Google post\nEvery Monday at 9:00, Localnord suggests a subject for the listing, writes the post in the listing's language and publishes it on Google. Set `status` to `draft` in **Create the post** to review posts in Localnord first.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create an API key in Localnord: Settings › API (https://app.localnord.io/dashboard/settings/api?utm_source=github&utm_medium=n8n&utm_campaign=localnord-automation-templates).\n2. In each orange HTTP node, pick a **Header Auth** credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer lnk_…`.\n3. Paste your listing ID in **Settings** (Localnord › listing › URL, or `GET /v1/listings`).\n",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "0da43aa9-d815-5705-aa89-7e74734d6ca7",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "c2a290e6-43e3-5ff6-9c0c-543752b1d6e6",
      "name": "Every Monday at 9:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e5d3b4a0-3296-5772-aa13-fce9e5ea7ab4",
              "name": "listing_id",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_LISTING_ID",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "163dfcf3-6ddc-598f-a6ff-7b701fb44f3c",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://app.localnord.io/api/v1/publications/generate-subjects",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ listing_id: $json.listing_id, count: 3, mix: { news: 3 } }) }}"
      },
      "id": "001163dd-2dfc-56ab-a4f1-8d3cec25d615",
      "name": "Suggest subjects",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// First suggested subject that needs no fact from you (price, date…).\nconst subjects = $input.first().json.data?.subjects ?? [];\nconst pick = subjects.find((s) => !s.needs_validation);\nif (!pick) return [];\nconst { listing_id } = $('Settings').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { listing_id, subject: pick.subject } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "12913d96-9d95-5a36-9593-5e1da5f47490",
      "name": "Pick a subject",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://app.localnord.io/api/v1/publications/generate-text",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ listing_id: $json.listing_id, subject: $json.subject, tone: 'warm' }) }}"
      },
      "id": "2a589c79-2b63-57a1-8601-a2b93bc5002e",
      "name": "Write the post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "87c022f8-32f9-58fd-979c-0824aad06e88",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.texts }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "array",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4fdee348-ccbb-505d-a324-b978e6e85fa3",
      "name": "Text ready?",
